#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduccion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kapptemplate; generates &kde; 4 templates to help you start easily &kde; "
"programming."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kapptemplate; runs in konsole or any terminal and you start it by typing "
"<userinput>kapptemplate</userinput> at the prompt."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "You are then presented with the templates list."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are three kinds of templates:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "1. a simple &kde; 4 application"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "2. a full featured &kde; 4 framework application"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "3. a KParts &kde; 4 application"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose one template and type its number then fill in the details of your "
"project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kapptemplate;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter describes the templates so you can choose the one that is the "
"best adapted to your needs."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generating the &kde; 4 simple application template"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the kde4 simple application"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "kde4 simple application"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This template demonstrates how you create &kde; menus using XMLGui and how "
"to use KConfig XT to change settings using the <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &lt;AppName&gt;</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the kde4 simple application settings dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "kde4 template settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please note in the config dialog that there are tooltips to help the user "
"understanding each setting. These tooltips can either be written directly in "
"Qt Designer for each widget or be added in the subclass. A tooltip consists "
"on only a few words describing the use of the widget."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>A tooltip</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A tooltip</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Furthermore using <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Shift;<keycap>F1</keycap></"
"keycombo> the user can see QWhatsThis help which helps him to understand "
"better what each setting does. This QWhatsThis help can either be written "
"directly in Qt Designer for each widget or be added in the subclass. It "
"should be more detailed than the tooltip and can use HTML markup such as "
"bold, color or italic."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>QWhatsThis</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>QWhatsThis</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can find some great tutorials for &kde; 4 on <ulink url=\"http://"
"techbase.kde.org/Development/Tutorials\">http://techbase.kde.org/Development/"
"Tutorials</ulink>."
msgstr ""

